<%= @order.customer.name %> (<%= PhoneNumber.display(@order.customer.phone) %>) ordered online for collection at <%= @order.branch.name %>.
<%= "Note: #{@order.note}" if @order.note.present? %>

<% @order.lines.includes(:product).each do |line| %>
<%= quantity(line.quantity, line.unit) %> x <%= line.description %>  <%= money(line.total_cents) %>
<% end %>
Total <%= money(@order.total_cents) %>

Open it: <%= customer_order_url(@order, subdomain: @account.subdomain) %>
Mark it ready when it's packed and the customer gets a text.
